Wyncoll</surname><given-names>D</given-names></name><name><surname>Janes</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Booth</surname><given-names>FV</given-names></name><name><surname>Wang</surname><given-names>D</given-names></name><name><surname>Sundin</surname><given-names>DP</given-names></name><name><surname>Macias</surname><given-names>WL</given-names></name><collab>Xigris and Prophylactic HepaRin Evaluation in Severe Sepsis (XPRESS) Study Group</collab></person-group><article-title>Prophylactic heparin in patients with severe sepsis treated with drotrecogin alfa (activated)</article-title><source>Am J Respir Crit Care Med</source><year>2007</year><volume>176</volume><fpage>483</fpage><lpage>490</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">17556722</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1164/rccm.200612-1803OC</pub-id></citation></ref></ref-list></back></article>